      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm a bit confused by the comparison. What do you mean by the \"messy cave\" part? Can you stick to the actual science of how the protein levels influence the enzymatic activity and the microbial stability? I'm trying to understand the chemical mechanism here.",
